<h1 style=3D"text-align: left;" id=3D"CurrentStateDelegation-DelegationPatt=
erns">Delegation Patterns</h1>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 94=
.9791%;">
  <colgroup>
   <col style=3D"width: 26.1995%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 39.7401%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 34.0604%;">
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Firm =E2=86=92 Partner(s) with=
in NBIN network</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Multi-Relationship</th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Firm =E2=86=92 Partner(s) outside NBIN netwo=
rk</th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><img class=3D"drawio-diagram-image" width=3D"381" style=3D"width:3=
81px;max-width: 100%;" src=3D"3aefa5b907f8343e4c8b9f0264df7c370401d01401818=
b34828281de2fde7bf2" height=3D"201"></p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><img class=3D"drawio-diagram-image" width=3D"468" style=3D"width:6=
00px;max-width: 100%;" src=3D"3274840179079a5b8ed402aca9a1117bf1371d7c51df4=
0749fee02af708ab748" height=3D"241"></p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p>:question:&nbsp;</p>
     </div></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"c697adf2-d88c-4383-8b16-72eb10d60754">Sub-advisory r=
elationship enabled by cross-RR access for trading and asset servicing (ord=
er mgmt., trade allocations, corporate actions), in this case Allard has ac=
cess to Altium accounts in addition to their own accounts</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"2ac73041-33ab-4c7a-a34e-09c0e1335cb9">Referral relat=
ionship enabled by cross-RR access to view accounts&nbsp;</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"1d048c5b-4227-4733-a209-8056dc2f7713">In some cases =
both hierarchy and delegation exists for a firm, or firms act as both prima=
ry and delegate</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"d3f81d8f-e2f1-4cab-8eca-89164e19bd47">Blue =3D singl=
e firms; green / yellow / purple&nbsp;- parent groups</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"56915220-1449-4141-baa3-a36943816638">Users are onbo=
arded as firm employees</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"3c017011-1ac4-4f50-bb68-4afd21f7f6f7">These are diff=
icult to identify but should be declared on the platform</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<p><br></p>
<h1 style=3D"text-align: left;" id=3D"CurrentStateDelegation-UserJourney:Ac=
cessManagement">User Journey: Access Management</h1>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 98=
.0524%;">
  <colgroup class=3D"">
   <col class=3D"" style=3D"width: 8.26701%;">
   <col class=3D"" style=3D"width: 20.6425%;">
   <col class=3D"" style=3D"width: 23.4983%;">
   <col class=3D"" style=3D"width: 23.0474%;">
   <col class=3D"" style=3D"width: 24.5004%;">
  </colgroup>
  <tbody class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh"><br></th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Delegate Setup =E2=86=92</p></th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Access Provisioning =E2=86=92</p></th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Ongoing Management &amp; Attestations =E2=86=92</p></th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Delegate Offboarding</p></th>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Activities</p></th>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#e6fcff confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e6fcff">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"cff549d4-e71a-4079-8d42-ce049fbe6d55">Agreement is s=
igned between firms to formalize the nature of the relationship</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#e6fcff confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e6fcff">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"ef0ae587-f738-4725-812e-69ed10a24802">User request i=
s initiated by the delegating firm for delegate users</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#e6fcff confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e6fcff">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"31d113bd-c17c-4eb6-bbe1-632173af9625">FSS may modify=
 allowable accounts based on changes in relationship</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"e7238a25-360d-4522-9e39-0a6bb7666363">FSS must revie=
w and attest quarterly to user accesses</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#e6fcff confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e6fcff">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"4c5ff235-2394-4ab1-b8f4-2e24e9866b18">For closing of=
 relationship FSS of delegated firm :question: submits request to remove us=
er(s)</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>User Interactions</p></th>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#e6fcff confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e6fcff">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"6dc0884c-c56c-43a4-84f5-b60332d881cc"><span>Email co=
rrespondence to discuss their needs, e.g. what are their PM sub-advisory fi=
rms, who are the users, and are they our clients, which RR's will be used, =
are new ones required</span></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"23368e9f-c1d3-42b5-84e1-a11aaa79e653">
       <p><span>Set up any new RR codes in AS400, add them to the PM sub-ad=
vising firm in NetRep</span></p>
       <ul>
        <li class=3D"paragraph-child">
         <p><span>e.g. A48G is in Highview range but assigned to Guardian f=
or sub-advising. So, the code will be added to Guardian range in NetRep (in=
 addition to Highview)</span></p></li>
       </ul></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"90baaf69-d417-4f1e-a749-08a3f7d6736a">Access agreeme=
nt is signed with NBIN to document firm's explicit consent and for traceabi=
lity</li>
      <li class=3D"paragraph-child" data-uuid=3D"c3ea94fd-5c0a-4fd9-b7b1-c1=
aa49e40142">
       <p><span>Client and their PM sub-advisory firms return the signed Ag=
reement</span></p></li>
      <li class=3D"paragraph-child" data-uuid=3D"587969ae-02fd-4cf8-b5a2-0d=
0c75f02eb4">
       <p><span>Send the signed Agreement to Risk team to validate and for =
filing</span></p></li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#e6fcff confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e6fcff">
     <ul>
      <li class=3D"paragraph-child" data-uuid=3D"7bbae03f-3770-4223-b164-f3=
ed4f86fa6d">
       <p><span>Firm provides the names of the PM sub-advisors and the resp=
ective sub-advisor RR code</span></p></li>
      <li class=3D"paragraph-child" data-uuid=3D"8fdb327f-5a4f-4773-91ae-26=
c6dfc0cfac">
       <p><span>Set up the PM sub-advisor user profiles</span></p></li>
      <li class=3D"paragraph-child" data-uuid=3D"a88ee0dd-55e7-4358-b814-98=
d9f85aa0b2">
       <p><span>Optional: Convert RR codes of existing client accounts</spa=
n></p>
       <ul>
        <li class=3D"paragraph-child">
         <p><span>In this case, the PM firm has existing client accounts wh=
ich are opened with their home firm RR code (e.g. A48F). They want to consi=
gn these accounts to their sub-advisor. Hence, when the PM sub-advisors are=
 ready, Implementation team will update the RR code for these accounts</spa=
n></p></li>
       </ul></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"18e84e19-a689-4f17-b921-2d7036ae612b">:question: It =
is unclear how view-only access is granted in R2 for referral agents</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#e6fcff confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e6fcff">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"1562be4f-a059-4d80-bed9-9f4683752e54">Quarterly atte=
station report is received by FSS of both firms for review and actioning</l=
i>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#e6fcff confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e6fcff">
     <p class=3D""><span>1. In NetRep,&nbsp;</span></p>
     <ul>
      <li style=3D"list-style-type: none;" data-uuid=3D"dfb95b76-e467-418b-=
8ab7-4c80122715f8">
       <ul class=3D"">
        <li class=3D"paragraph-child">
         <p class=3D""><span>Remove the sub-advisor RR code from the sub-ad=
vising firm</span></p>
         <ul class=3D"">
          <li class=3D"paragraph-child">
           <p class=3D""><span>Effect: Sub-advisors will not be able to tra=
de for those client accounts any more.</span></p></li>
         </ul></li>
       </ul></li>
     </ul>
     <p><span>2. In OSS,</span></p>
     <ul>
      <li style=3D"list-style-type: none;" data-uuid=3D"34faa39a-a6ac-4273-=
b522-f17e3070ddb9">
       <ul class=3D"">
        <li class=3D"paragraph-child">
         <p class=3D""><span>Rebrand the RR code in OSS</span></p>
         <ul class=3D"">
          <li class=3D"paragraph-child">
           <p class=3D""><span>Effect: Move them back to home firm RR code<=
/span></p></li>
         </ul></li>
       </ul></li>
     </ul>
     <p class=3D""><span>3. In R2,</span></p>
     <ul>
      <li style=3D"list-style-type: none;" data-uuid=3D"bcac936a-17b1-4054-=
b039-b452ff96754f">
       <ul class=3D"">
        <li class=3D"paragraph-child">
         <p class=3D""><span>Remove the PM sub-advisor RR codes from the us=
ers or offboard the users</span></p></li>
       </ul></li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>User Pain Points</p></th>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#ffecf8 confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
ffecf8">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"65df79c6-30da-42ba-ab59-d99837275bd7"><span style=3D=
"color:#172B4D;">The contract signing workflow is not digitalized.&nbsp;&nb=
sp;</span></li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#ffecf8 confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
ffecf8">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"66d4678b-d571-4b0f-877d-7d6828a41491">Firm-level acc=
ess for sub-advisors is currently not supported (looks like there may be us=
e cases for this)</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"0cb114a2-6867-4d71-976f-474eb4ccff5b">User lists are=
 exchanged via email</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"2c67f647-9cde-48a8-8847-f36ac30591de">Instructions a=
re placed in free=E2=80=91text notes to add PM sub=E2=80=91advisor RR codes=
</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"9da9940a-d897-485d-879a-b429b25f65e4">:question: Ver=
ify R2 cross-broker code RR assignment limitation</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#ffecf8 confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
ffecf8">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"da4b7575-7819-474d-a445-a6d079826548">:question: If =
the case is possible that the delegated firm can request sub-advisor RR acc=
ess, then this would be missed in the delegating firm's audit</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#ffecf8 confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
ffecf8">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"373ec3a8-8570-4232-b5b5-611a3dc6c366">For relationsh=
ip offboarding is not self-service, must go through NBIN</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"a8f166f8-9380-4e9d-9a63-66f7d57c1c9d">&nbsp;Unclear =
attestation process can expose firm to incomplete employee offboarding proc=
esses</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Business Frictions</p></th>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#ffecf8 confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
ffecf8">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"18dd1f0e-bd72-4b62-ab82-b9f8ce2aa1bb">Sub=E2=80=91ad=
visory agreement is facilitated manually by Client Implementation teams; ag=
reement is validated by Risk team but not registered in a system of record =
accessible to downstream platforms</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#ffecf8 confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
ffecf8">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"474c8418-82db-4ced-b17e-a2ee9df22dff">Provisioning p=
rocess / standards historically have been inconsistent, leading to profile =
discrepancies - e.g. mismatches in first/last name when users were setup wi=
th their firm as prefix in first name</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"ac5b98f2-ccf7-4829-91f9-df84f255f7d7">Number of cons=
istencies across systems where e.g. SZ provisions MORE access than NetRep a=
nd R2</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"d4798468-9a84-4d26-8a56-9728553e9610">R2 validation =
only checks RR code ranges, not whether a valid sub=E2=80=91advisory agreem=
ent exists</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"20e57516-fb4c-4df4-b6f4-adf03f113b97">:question: Unc=
lear how existing platform users are identified in this process</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#ffecf8 confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
ffecf8">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"7ce69d3f-22d0-4c90-85fc-92a23cf58554">In some cases,=
 even an audit reveals unclear relationships e.g. Fola Elemide&nbsp;@ IPC w=
ith access to Bellwether accounts - this is not a valid relationship but th=
ere is no auditability</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"8e35b0c3-c6dd-42a8-bdf0-36602665dcb4">No unique ID, =
relies of fuzzy matching may result in data breaches</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#ffecf8 confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
ffecf8">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"14432708-4c90-4dee-94df-548794b4fd26">Manual operati=
ons across multiple systems with structural change (moving RR's!)</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Opportunities</p></th>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#e3fcef confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e3fcef">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"f6b660f2-9724-4541-9c56-31d21b7640de">Formal trackin=
g of relationships within platform to assist in <span class=3D"inline-comme=
nt-marker" data-ref=3D"cfd67a43-4fda-401f-910f-c8a468083002">firm identific=
ation</span> and possibly add control point</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#e3fcef confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e3fcef">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"10df9b79-fe7f-4388-a3a0-7f64479d4331">Help FSS clari=
fy and capture delegation intent</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#e3fcef confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e3fcef">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"289cf5ac-6524-4a5d-afb9-14eb9195862f">:question: Act=
ivity reporting for those delegated users</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#e3fcef confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e3fcef">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"0c945ba2-99e3-4438-ba6d-bb6c83908120">Facilitate fir=
m offboarding</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"60ae2b29-1daa-46bc-94d7-d4fa995a7c03">Improve PM vis=
ibility and control around user management</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Constraints &amp; Considerations</p></th>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><br></p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li><span style=3D"color:#333333;">Are there unknown limitations with=
 cross-broker access to impose moving of RR's as the solution...</span></li=
>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><br></p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<p><br></p>
<p>:question: Feature access analysis TBC to determine if all sub-advisors =
outside of R2 have the same feature permissions</p>
