e6fcff" rowspan=3D"2">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"4dd5663c-7194-4fa9-9181-79dfea19e5cc">User logs into=
 CX / NetRep / SZ with their primary ID</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#e6fcff confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e6fcff">
     <p>In CX, R2 or NR:</p>
     <ul style=3D"text-align: left;">
