     <ul style=3D"text-align: left;">
      <li data-uuid=3D"30e8f48e-1751-4194-962d-39479a47d220">Order entry an=
d submission for all asset classes</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"b36ad2ca-bc4f-4884-a38d-86dcffc40343">Order list / s=
tatus view</li>
