     <p>In R2:</p>
     <ul style=3D"text-align: left;">
      <li data-uuid=3D"b5413d21-3abf-421d-849b-826d90ccf3de">Submission of =
a Mutual Funds Basket</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"1a3342f6-f29c-4725-af9e-468b24bf24a0">Submission of =
a Trade Advice for trade allocation</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"d5aea3bb-a7ea-40d8-9624-93bd6cf69c8b">Manage corpora=
te actions</li>
     </ul>
