istory</li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"4cf522c0-0ff8-45fa-9b80-55d947c4e2c0">Holdings</li>
      </ul>
      <li>:question:&nbsp; Perform client onboarding</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#e6fcff confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e6fcff">
     <p title=3D"">N/A</p></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#e6fcff confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e6fcff">N/A</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th colspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>User Pain Points</p></th>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#ffecf8 confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
ffecf8">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"2ebe9327-cb6b-4410-9cde-c8635d39bbf4">Multiple ID's =
sometimes to access different firm's accounts</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#ffecf8 confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
ffecf8">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"409bb29b-a8d7-4809-808a-601afc5b40a5">For users with=
 multiple ID's, have to login separately to perform these activities&nbsp;<=
/li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"616c2342-625b-43f7-99a0-811f9d9fee87">Accounts for d=
elegated firm's own accounts and sub-advising accounts are co-mingled, user=
s have to know the RR's to identify them</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#ffecf8 confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
ffecf8">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"1c951e68-3b6e-4942-8715-4650bfc2b428">Generally frag=
mented - for users with multiple ID's, have to login separately to perform =
these activities in NetRep, but in R2 the file uploads may work</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#ffecf8 confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
ffecf8">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"1c9ea1e7-6e53-4f4d-9587-4ac2a40cee41">TBC - not rese=
arched</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th colspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Business Frictions</p></th>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#ffecf8 confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
ffecf8">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"bf4af5a7-6045-4036-9125-2a3eb6e74091">Cannot easily =
uniquely identify individuals and their complete access profile</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#ffecf8 confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
ffecf8">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"834d6d3f-2ada-4525-8b20-91122eb19651">None of the pl=
atforms support "basic view-only" to hide PII not relevant for delegate use=
rs - privacy risk</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#ffecf8 confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
ffecf8">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"31dd94bb-d17b-47f3-b7b6-704a63968f2d">None identifie=
d to-date</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#ffecf8 confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
ffecf8">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"eb3fb113-4c83-4a8b-baf6-eff50dc55918">None identifie=
d to-date</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th colspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Opportunities</p></th>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#e3fcef confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e3fcef">
     <ul style=3D"text-align: left;">
      <li data-uuid=3D"21b32087-d76b-4aeb-b095-029862687711">Unified login =
in CX</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#e3fcef confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e3fcef">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"7be88ade-0375-467d-a5bf-6b9d4330eff2">Improve data c=
onfidentiality controls</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"dd775fef-251b-45f7-87ea-ded25c1a05b6">Clear identifi=
cation of which accounts belong to which firm</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#e3fcef confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e3fcef">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"e8b4e22a-d0f0-4f87-8835-f6e10ae4aa89">TBC</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#e3fcef confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e3fcef">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"7e6b410b-1028-459e-bfb6-c2295a6b25dc">Can investigat=
e capabilities to support this</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th colspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Constraints &amp; Considerations</p></th>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><br></p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
